// ExampleRender pins the realm's root Render output as a testable example.
// The `123456789` row is the standard CRC-32 check value, so this example
// doubles as a conformance test for the library.
func ExampleRender() {
	print(Render(""))
	// Output:
	// # CRC-32
	//
	// The IEEE checksum behind zip, gzip and PNG, demoing the [`p/moul/x/daily/crc32`](/p/nym-moultest123/x/daily/crc32/v0) library.
	//
	// | input | crc32 |
	// |---|---|
	// | _(empty)_ | `00000000` |
	// | `a` | `e8b7be43` |
	// | `abc` | `352441c2` |
	// | `123456789` | `cbf43926` |
	// | `hello world` | `0d4a1185` |
	// | `hello worle` | `7a4d2113` |
