	//
	// [Open a mine](/r/nym-moultest123/x/games/idle/v0$help&func=Start) | [Claim](/r/nym-moultest123/x/games/idle/v0$help&func=Claim) | [Upgrade](/r/nym-moultest123/x/games/idle/v0$help&func=Upgrade) | [Prestige](/r/nym-moultest123/x/games/idle/v0$help&func=Prestige)
